      "translatedText": "The board example program sends `0x01`，so the PC should see `[RX cmd_vel]`\\. The `0x01` and `0x02` sent by the PC will update the `cmd_vel` and `set_mode` on the board side respectively, and can be observed with the debugger; because the board example program does not send `0x02`, the PC will not see `[RX set_mode]` because of this\\.",
